    "final_answer": "I have found the information about Jerry Trainor's upcoming projects. Here is my answer:\n\n## Jerry Trainor's Upcoming Projects\n\nBased on my research, Jerry Trainor's upcoming projects include:\n\n1. **\"Untitled iCarly Movie\"** – He will reprise his role as **Spencer Shay** in this new iCarly movie.\n\n2. **Third Season of the iCarly Reboot** – He has wrapped up filming for the third season of the iCarly revival series, reprising his role as Spencer Shay.\n\n**Additional notes:**\n- He is also confirmed for several **convention appearances** through 2025-2026, including GalaxyCon St. Louis, Scaradise in Tampa, and FanX Salt Lake Comic Convention (with 2 more appearances confirmed for 2026).\n\n**Sources consulted:** Google search results referencing Instagram, Wikipedia (filmography up to 2022/2023), Facebook, TVGuide, and Rotten Tomatoes. Note that IMDb returned a 403 error during my research, so I was unable to verify the IMDb-specific listings of \"Turbo Undercover Fighting Force Squad\" and \"Predator: Killer of Killers (2025)\" that appeared in the search snippet.",
